      "message": "test(app): pin the recorded q02 mould import and slices\n\nAdd the recorded QA part of #3034 as testdata/models/q02_3d_mold.step\n(byte for byte, 347101 bytes, sha256 111862a3...9567) and the app\nregression import_step_q02_mold: the part imports closed, its volume\nagrees with SolidCraft within 10 mm^3, and five slices (the reported\nz = 19.6875 included) close with their measured areas. With\nmesh_deviation.rs put back to upstream/main the test fails with the\nissue's own refusal (\"face Some(10) stands 5.089e-1 mm off its\nsurface\"). The fixture has its step_agreement row.\n\nRefs #3034\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
